adratic form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{T}\\,Ax & =2{x}_{1}{x}_{1}+1{x}_{1}{x}_{2}+0{x}_{1}{x}_{3}+1{x}_{2}{x}_{1}+(-2){x}_{2}{x}_{2}+0{x}_{2}{x}_{3}+0{x}_{3}{x}_{1}+0{x}_{3}{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3}{x}_{3} \\\\  & =2{x}_{1}^{2}+{x}_{1}{x}_{2}+{x}_{2}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}^{2}+2{x}_{3}^{2} \\\\  & =2{x}_{1}^{2}+2{x}_{1}{x}_{2}-2{x}_{2}^{2}+2{x}_{3}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Method 2**\n\nTo write down a quadratic form in terms of vector components, we compute the following expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{T}\\,Ax & =[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & {x}_{2} & {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & {x}_{2} & {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{3}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={x}_{1}(2{x}_{1}+{x}_{2})+{x}_{2}({x}_{1}-2{x}_{2})+{x}_{3}(2{x}_{3}) \\\\  & =2{x}_{1}^{2}+{x}_{1}{x}_{2}+{x}_{2}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{x}^{2}+2{x}_{3}^{2} \\\\  & =2{x}_{1}^{2}+2{x}_{1}{x}_{2}-2{x}_{2}^{2}+2{x}_{3}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378355 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378356 13194139535987 true] [17592186378355 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378357 13194139535987 true] [17592186378355 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378358 13194139535987 true] [17592186378355 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378359 13194139535987 true] [17592186378355 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378360 13194139535987 true] [17592186378355 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535987 true] [17592186378355 1041 "selection" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378355 1104 #edb/ref 17592186378357 13194139535987 true] [17592186378355 1110 #uuid "31f4de6a-117b-5bff-975f-36877d5896e7" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378356 1034 "2{x}_{2}^{2}+2{x}_{1}{x}_{2}-2{x}_{3}^{2}" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378356 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535987 true] [17592186378356 1111 #uuid "1b8f1235-5983-5e6b-b148-6360b2fcc54c" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378357 1034 "2{x}_{1}^{2}+2{x}_{1}{x}_{2}-2{x}_{2}^{2}+2{x}_{3}^{2}" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378357 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535987 true] [17592186378357 1111 #uuid "81306264-a231-5fb1-8e6e-5600200ac2eb" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378358 1034 "2{x}_{1}^{2}+2{x}_{1}{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3}^{2}" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378358 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535987 true] [17592186378358 1111 #uuid "f0da357d-1e07-5173-aaec-d0d762ab1b72" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378359 1034 "2{x}_{1}^{2}+2{x}_{1}{x}_{2}-2{x}_{2}^{2}" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378359 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535987 true] [17592186378359 1111 #uuid "89be66ea-03c0-5114-9143-f891e4a143e7" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378360 1034 "{x}_{1}^{2}+2{x}_{1}{x}_{3}+2{x}_{2}^{2}-2{x}_{3}^{2}" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378360 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535987 true] [17592186378360 1111 #uuid "3f58ae66-2a2a-5e0a-88d7-a5cda53451a7" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378361 1017 #edb/ref 17592186378362 13194139535987 true] [17592186378361 1089 "q-94116" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378361 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535987 true] [17592186378361 1100 "$$\n[\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ b & -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe matrix of the quadratic form $Q(x)=-2{x}_{1}^{2}-10{x}_{1}{x}_{2}-3{x}_{2}^{2}\\,$ is given above. What is the value of $a+b?$" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378361 1113 #uuid "17223c22-baa8-51fd-870b-c084f2c85b4f" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378361 1145 "Since the matrix of the quadratic form must be symmetric, we rewrite our expression as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Q(x) & =-2{x}_{1}^{2}-10{x}_{1}{x}_{2}-3{x}_{2}^{2} \\\\  & =(-2){x}_{1}^{2}+(-5){x}_{1}{x}_{2} \\\\  & +\\,(-5){x}_{2}{x}_{1}+(-3){x}_{2}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that to get a symmetric matrix, we must split the coefficient of $-10{x}_{1}{x}_{2}$ between the entries \n\n$$\n{a}_{12}={a}_{21}=\\frac{-10}{2}=-5\n$$\n\nof our matrix. So, the matrix corresponding to our quadratic form is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -5 \\\\ -5 & -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=-2$ and $b=-5.$ Finally, \n\n$$\na+b=-2+(-5)=-7.\n$$" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378362 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378363 13194139535987 true] [17592186378362 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378364 13194139535987 true] [17592186378362 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378365 13194139535987 true] [17592186378362 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378366 13194139535987 true] [17592186378362 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378367 13194139535987 true] [17592186378362 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535987 true] [17592186378362 1041 "selection" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378362 1104 #edb/ref 17592186378363 13194139535987 true] [17592186378362 1110 #uuid "efb2f6a8-6a6c-58c9-b5eb-d20e4ea07ca7" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378363 1034 "-7" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378363 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535987 true] [17592186378363 1111 #uuid "90e86eec-31b7-5bd9-a6fc-90890ae830e9" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378364 1034 "-5" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378364 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535987 true] [17592186378364 1111 #uuid "a29c1ca5-4e9c-582c-ba01-bc743b01e2c4" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378365 1034 "2" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378365 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535987 true] [17592186378365 1111 #uuid "f534f31e-28eb-5ff1-abda-293ab86a0306" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378366 1034 "-3" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378366 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535987 true] [17592186378366 1111 #uuid "cac3577f-897f-5a07-a3d7-f0175f21c115" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378367 1034 "-2" 13194139535987 true] [17592186378367 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535987 true] [17592186378367 1111 #uuid "891ce537-9085-56b7-ae6f-e9125d0971ad" 13194139535987 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-140929" 17592186378340 "q-140929/selection" 17592186378341 "q-140929/selection/801bcdd9cb6a10cec998162e05f71050c8aaf0c6974f095bdcaef715a09f4aee" 17592186378342 "q-140929/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921